<BlogLayout
  title="Chevy Equinox EV Charging Cost at Home vs Supercharger (2026 Monthly Breakdown) | VoltSavings"
  description="Real 2026 Chevy Equinox EV charging costs at home vs Superchargers. Full 85 kWh battery breakdown, TOU night rates, and monthly gas SUV savings."
