          <td class="p-3.5 text-red-700">~$160.00 / year (2 changes)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="bg-emerald-50/80 border-t-2 border-emerald-300 font-semibold">
          <td class="p-3.5 font-black text-gray-950">Net 5-Year Pocket Savings (60,000 mi)</td>
